argument:: path
argument:: fftSize
argument:: hop
argument:: steps
Number of thresholds.
argument:: lo
argument:: hi
argument:: title
argument:: width
argument:: height

METHOD:: new
Any detection function, 0 to 1.
argument:: values
argument:: frameRate
argument:: steps
argument:: lo
argument:: hi
argument:: title
argument:: width
argument:: height

METHOD:: sweep
The peaks at each threshold, as frame indices.
argument:: values
argument:: thresholds
argument:: minGapFrames

METHOD:: outside
The share of the curve's total that lies below a threshold.
argument:: values
argument:: threshold

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: threshold
The chosen cut.
METHOD:: minGap
Seconds; setting it resweeps.
METHOD:: onsetTimes
The events at the chosen cut, in seconds.
METHOD:: rows
METHOD:: thresholds
METHOD:: values
METHOD:: frameRate
METHOD:: offset
Seconds from a frame's start to the middle of its window.
METHOD:: duration
METHOD:: gapFrames
METHOD:: countWidth
METHOD:: curveShare

EXAMPLES::
code::
c = PltCut.fromSoundFile(Platform.resourceDir +/+ "sounds/a11wlk01.wav").front;
c.threshold_(0.5);
c.minGap_(0.15);     // fewer, and different, events at every threshold
c.onsetTimes;
::
